 "description": "1U single-sided UHD horizontal cable manager: a black ABS finger duct 175 mm deep with a hinged cover. A back plate between the rack ears carries a wall of ten T-shaped fingers along its top edge and another along its bottom, each wall five moulded blocks of two, and the cover latches over the finger heads to close a channel that runs the width of the rack. The cover is 52 mm high, taller than the 44 mm ears. Three pass-through windows in the plate lead cables to the other side.",
